# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/ -- ignore generated research/diagnostic
# output by default, keep only checked-in workflow code/docs/config. This is
# ONE consolidated block (A109 gitignore cleanup): a prior version spread this
# across four separately-added sections without ordering awareness, which put
# a later, broader blanket ignore AFTER an earlier per-file allowlist -- git
# resolves overlapping patterns by "last match in the file wins", so that
# earlier allowlist was silently shadowed and dead (verified via
# `git check-ignore --no-index`). It only "worked" because every affected file
# was already tracked before the shadowing was introduced, and .gitignore has
# no effect on already-tracked files. ANY exception to the blanket ignore
# below MUST be listed after it, in this same block -- do not add a new
# per-file `!` rule earlier in this file, it will be silently overridden here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/*
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/

# -- workflow code: keep every diagnostics script trackable by default,
#    including ones not yet written, so a new script never needs `git add -f` --
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/*.py
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/*.ps1

# -- core governance docs (must stay tracked) --
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/ACCEPTANCE.md
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/WORK_LOG.md
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/NEXT_WORK.md
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/AUTOMATION_PROMPT.md
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/simnow_daily_observation_workflow.md
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/simnow_connection_probe.md
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/simnow_candidate_v1_monitoring.md
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/simnow_candidate_v1_robustness_summary.md

# -- active config/state read by code at a fixed path (not disposable
#    research output, do not treat like dated report artifacts) --
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/simnow_connection_config.example.json
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/simnow_contract_map.json
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/simnow_risk_thresholds.json
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/simnow_observation_window.json
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/platform_base_block1buy_sc075_config.json
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/platform_final_candidate_config.json

# -- checked-in report artifacts (deliberately committed, not regenerated
#    fresh each run) --
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/position_sizing_report_*.json
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/czsc_upgrade_behavior_diff_report.md
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/czsc_upgrade_failure_attribution.md

# -- A108: diagnostics/research/ archives non-.py research output artifacts
#    (still generated, still ignored as a whole) except the migration audit
#    trail itself --
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/research/
examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/research/*
!examples/czsc_strategy/diagnostics/research/MIGRATION_LOG.md

# Skill evaluation report generated locally
SKILL_audit_report.md

